# Cal.com username used for the Online Sessions booking page.
# Sign up at https://cal.com, then create event types with these exact slugs
# under your account: consultation, cv-review, linkedin-review, mock-exam.
# NOTE: this is a Vite build-time variable — after changing it you must
# rebuild the frontend (npm run build / build-prod.sh) for it to take effect.
VITE_CAL_USERNAME=your-cal-username
